<title>UK: Morgan Guaranty adds 500 bln lire to 30-year bond.</title>
<headline>Morgan Guaranty adds 500 bln lire to 30-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, has been increased by a further 500 billion lire to 2.0 trillion lire, joint lead managers J.P. Morgan and Cariplo said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MORGAN GUARANTY TRUST CO NEW YORK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 TRLN LIRE COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    21.JAN.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 ZERO	ISS PRICE  12.85     PAY DATE    21.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC   1.65</p>
